#ROOM
Vnum     51423
Name     Noxian Final Navigation Challenge~
Sector   city~
Flags    indoors safe~
Desc     You are almost finished. The graduation hall is immediately north, but the
door is locked. The child here appears upset and may know how to open it.
Finding and returning the child's lost toy should help.

Hints: find the lost toy give the toy to the child ask about the key

The final challenge takes place beneath displays of Noxian night-sky charts,
scouting records and understated clan insignia.
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    51424
Key       51523
Flags     isdoor closed locked~
#ENDEXIT

