Reset D 0 51423 0 2
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51424
Name     Noxian Graduation Gallery~
Sector   city~
Desc     You completed the academy course. Proceed through the graduation gallery,
receive your diploma and continue toward the docking bay.

The gallery is a transparent orbital walkway attached to Noxian Nightwatch
Academy. Instead of a city beneath you, the windows reveal TRAPPIST-1 f
hanging beneath the station in the faint light of its ultracool star.
Structural ribs frame the corridor while traffic lights from local shuttles
move silently beyond the glass.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    51423
Flags     isdoor~
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction up~
ToRoom    51425
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 51450 1 51424
Reset O 0 51514 1 51424
Reset D 0 51424 2 0
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51425
Name     TRAPPIST-1 f Orbital Dock~
Sector   city~
Desc     This docking bay projects from the academy station so that training shuttles
can approach without crossing the inhabited modules. Guidance lights, docking
clamps and service equipment line the perimeter.

Beyond the bay you can see TRAPPIST-1 f hanging beneath the station in the
faint light of its ultracool star. A small shuttle is waiting to carry
graduates down toward TRAPPIST-1 f. To board it, use ENTER.
~
#EXIT
Direction down~
ToRoom    51424
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction somewhere~
ToRoom    51426
Flags     hidden can_enter~
#ENDEXIT

Reset O 0 51422 1 51425
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51426
Name     TRAPPIST-1 f Planetfall Shuttle~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob~
Desc     You are inside a compact planetfall shuttle. Passenger seats sit directly
behind the pilot position, with a small service compartment at the rear. The
craft carries newly graduated students from Noxian Nightwatch Academy toward
TRAPPIST-1 f.

Give your diploma to the pilot when requested. If you do not yet have one, use
LEAVE and return to the graduation area.
~
#EXIT
Direction somewhere~
ToRoom    51425
Flags     hidden can_leave~
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 51455 1 51426
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51427
Name     Noxian Continuity Briefing~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob indoors prototype~
Desc     The final briefing concerns character continuity and recovery after death. In
this setting death can carry severe consequences, so make use of whatever
medical, backup or continuity services the wider game provides. Update those
safeguards regularly rather than waiting until after a major loss.

The briefing chamber uses silent low-emission sensors and controls optimized
for dim environments, while a status display shows the orbital position of
Noxian Nightwatch Academy above TRAPPIST-1 f.
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    51422
Flags     isdoor closed~
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    51417
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 51495 1 51427
Reset D 0 51427 0 1
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51499
Name     Noxian Academy Program Service Room~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob~Desc     This sealed service room exists for academy mobile programs and should not be
removed. Maintenance labels identify it as part of Noxian Nightwatch Academy's
internal automation network.
~

#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51500
Name     Noxian Academy Test Workshop~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob factory~Desc     A small test workshop used by academy staff. Benches, diagnostic ports and
silent low-emission sensors and controls optimized for dim environments fill
the room.
~

#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51501
Name     Noxian Quiet Test Compartment~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob safe silence~Desc     A deliberately quiet compartment isolated from the busier academy modules.
very low amber guide lights supplemented by unobtrusive instrument glow and
sound-damped surfaces make it suitable for testing or study.
~

#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51529
Name     Noxian Isolated Test Chamber~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob prototype~Desc     This isolated test chamber is intentionally featureless. Instrument panels
from silent low-emission sensors and controls optimized for dim environments
are the only obvious connection to the rest of Noxian Nightwatch Academy.
~

#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     51530
Name     Noxian Student Commons~
Sector   inside~
Flags    nomob safe~
Desc     This is the academy student commons, a final safe place to rest, read and
practice using the message system. Use NOTE LIST to list messages, NOTE READ
<msgnum> to read one, and HELP NOTE for additional commands.

The room is a dark, quiet commons with sheltered alcoves and almost no
unnecessary illumination. The station windows give occasional views of
TRAPPIST-1 f hanging beneath the station in the faint light of its ultracool
star.
~
#EXIT
Direction east~
ToRoom    51400
#ENDEXIT

Reset O 0 51514 1 51530
#ENDROOM

